{"headword":"כָּהַן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> only <strong>Pi.denom. act as priest</strong>;—Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּהֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:13\" href=\"/Exodus.40.13\">Ex 40:13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.36\">1 Ch 5:36</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּהֲנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:41\" href=\"/Exodus.28.41\">Ex 28:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:15\" href=\"/Exodus.40.15\">40:15</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְכַהֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:4\" href=\"/Numbers.3.4\">Nu 3:4</a> + 2 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְכַהֲנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.2\">1 Ch 24:2</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּהֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:1\" href=\"/Exodus.29.1\">Ex 29:1</a> + 11 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּהֲנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:1\" href=\"/Exodus.28.1\">Ex 28:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:3\" href=\"/Exodus.28.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:4\" href=\"/Exodus.28.4\">4</a>.—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>minister as a priest</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:10\" href=\"/Exodus.31.10\">Ex 31:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:19\" href=\"/Exodus.35.19\">35:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:41\" href=\"/Exodus.39.41\">39:41</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.32\">Lv 16:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:3\" href=\"/Numbers.3.3\">Nu 3:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:4\" href=\"/Numbers.3.4\">4</a> (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ לִי</span> <em>minister to me</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:1\" href=\"/Exodus.28.1\">Ex 28:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:3\" href=\"/Exodus.28.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:4\" href=\"/Exodus.28.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:41\" href=\"/Exodus.28.41\">41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:1\" href=\"/Exodus.29.1\">29:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:44\" href=\"/Exodus.29.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:30\" href=\"/Exodus.30.30\">30:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:13\" href=\"/Exodus.40.13\">40:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:15\" href=\"/Exodus.40.15\">15</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.13\">Ez 44:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:6\" href=\"/Hosea.4.6\">Ho 4:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ ליהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.35\">Lv 7:35</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.36\">1 Ch 5:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.2\">24:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.14\">2 Ch 11:14</a> (always of Aaron and his sons, except <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.13\">Ez 44:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.14\">2 Ch 11:14</a>, where Levites are forbidden to minister; and <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:6\" href=\"/Hosea.4.6\">Ho 4:6</a> of Israel, whose national priesthood is taken away)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be</em> or <em>become priest</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.6\">Dt 10:6</a> (E?)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>play the priest:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּחָתָן יְכַהֵן פְּאֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.10\">Is 61:10</a> <em>as a bridegroom</em> (<em>that</em>) <em>priests it with his turban</em>, decks himself with a splendid turban such as the priests wore."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB04394","strong_numbers":["3547"],"next_hw":"כְּהֻנָּה","prev_hw":"כֹּהֵן","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","quotes":[],"GK":["3912"],"TWOT":["959"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906",